# The github.com/jack-work/msauth revision this repository's source requires.
#
# jacques links the shared auth foundation as a Go LIBRARY, so a fix made in
# msauth reaches a user only when jacques is rebuilt and reinstalled. Nothing
# used to notice the gap: an installed jacques.exe could match jacques HEAD
# exactly and still carry auth code many foundation commits old.
#
# TestInstalledArtifactCarriesRequiredFoundation reads this floor and judges the
# installed binary against it. An artifact carrying this revision or any later
# one passes; anything older is a rebuild.
#
# Raise it when this repository starts depending on newer foundation behaviour,
# and rebuild + reinstall in the same change.
bffb52b
